            <div class="description-block">The CDSX® Security Master File provides comprehensive and timely details on CDSX-eligible securities, through a database of current securities and a daily / weekly / monthly file of updates.The Fixed Income Terms and Conditions product can be purchased with the security master file.</div>
        
